  8+  A800              ;       Carry set: A=error (20 invalid MBR, 21 no FAT16 partition,
  9+  A800              ;                  22 invalid BPB; storage errors are passed through).
 10+  A800              ;   P127_FAT16_ReadRootSector
 11+  A800              ;       HL = zero-based sector index in FAT16 root directory.
 12+  A800              ;       Reads one sector into p127_fat16_sector_buffer.
 13+  A800              ;       Carry clear on success; A=error on failure.
 14+  A800              ;
 15+  A800              ; Geometry exported as 32-bit little-endian values:
 16+  A800              ;   p127_fat16_partition_lba, p127_fat16_fat_lba,
